@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
title Original declaration and destination binding
top to bottom direction
state "Authorized native source" as Source
state "Attribution snapshot captured" as Captured
state "Draft source metadata carries UUID" as Draft
state "Verified migration origin binding" as Bound
[*] --> Source
Source --> Captured : accepted copy
Captured -left-> Draft : picker copy
Captured -right-> Bound : verified folder copy
Draft --> [*]
Bound --> [*]
note bottom of Captured
Original author / licence and parent UUID.
Technical actor anonymization is independent.
end note
@enduml
